<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-18783] DistributedProcess hangs if a single future completes with AssertionError</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18783</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;DistributedProcess#sendSingleMessage tries to cast local process future error to Exception, while it might completed with AssertionError.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In a such case SingleMessage isn&apos;t sent, and originated node hangs while waiting response from the node.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
